      "text": "Docker Desktop on Windows/macOS runs a small Linux VM so that Linux containers have a Linux kernel to share. (Windows also has its own separate \"Windows\ncontainers\".)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b21",
      "originalText": "Docker Desktop on Windows/macOS runs a small Linux VM so that Linux containers have a Linux kernel to share. (Windows also has its own separate \"Windows containers\".)",
